# shadcn/ui Components

Both homepages have shadcn/ui pre-installed (new-york style, neutral base color, CSS variables).

Available components in `@/components/ui/`: `button`, `card`, `input`, `label`, `select`, `textarea`.

- Import from `@/components/ui/<component>`, not from `shadcn/ui` or `@radix-ui` directly.
- Add new components with `bunx shadcn@latest add <component>` from the app root.
- Use `cn()` from `@/lib/utils` for conditional class merging.

```tsx
import { Button } from "@/components/ui/button";
import { Card, CardContent, CardHeader, CardTitle } from "@/components/ui/card";
import { Input } from "@/components/ui/input";
import { cn } from "@/lib/utils";
```
